  "worked_solution": "If we substitute $z=7$ into the given equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9z & =63 \\\\ 9\\cdot 7 & =63 \\\\ 63 & =63\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $z=7.$",
